### Test price update event for specific market
POST http://localhost:8000/events/price-updated/KRW-BTC

### Test price update event for another market  
POST http://localhost:8000/events/price-updated/KRW-ETH

### Test with invalid market
POST http://localhost:8000/events/price-updated/INVALID-MARKET

